															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lifebot" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2213042); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2213042&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606834604" alt="LifeBot" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2213042)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lifebot" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2213042); return false;" >LifeBot</a></span> <span class="odate time_1547428435 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">14 Jan 2019 01:13</span>
