<p>So I googled what a TARDIS was and I just spent an hour going down the Dr. Who rabbit hole. Damn it Mark why did you have to do this to me on a weekday :(</p>
<p>In all seriousness, thank you for the suggestions and the compliments. As far as your headcanon goes, it is definitely possible, so I wouldn't call it irrational at all.</p>
<p>I know that in the list of 'Missions' that the Silent Crusade undertook, the one for the Amisitar Massacre is the only one that deviates from IRL history. I originally intended it to be a mix of IRL history getting better, or IRL history being the 'better' version that was improved upon, but I somehow ended up with only 1 of the former. But yeah, if reading that Wikipedia article made you sad, don't watch the movie Gandhi :/ there's a scene there that features this exact event.</p>
<p>And on the technical side of things, how would I fix the issue you described regarding the picture? The original picture was rather large and had parts I did not want, so I used the snipping tool to trim out the part I wanted.</p>

